<title>UK: Granada gains as Kleinwort repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Granada gains as Kleinwort repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Granada Group Plc rose on Monday as analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson repeated a &quot;buy&quot; rating on the hotels and leisure group, dealers said.</p>
<p>Granada shares were up 7-1/2p at 880 by 0950 GMT in modest volume of 257,000 shares.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
